# Tech Stack (Backend Focus)

## Primary Stack

- **Laravel 12** (PHP 8.3) — API-only backend.
- **Laravel Sanctum 4** — SPA cookie-based authentication.
- **Filament 4** — admin panel (TALL stack, SSR), mounted on the same Laravel app.

## Data Layer

- **MySQL 8.4.3** — relational core, used for all transactional data (ACID).
- **Redis** — cache, queue driver, session store, AI conversation context (TTL 24h).
- **Meilisearch** — full-text search + vector search for the RAG chatbot.

## Third-party Services

- **Cloudinary** — image storage and on-the-fly optimization.
- **Google Gemini API** — LLM (chat completion) + embedding model for RAG.
- **VietQR** — dynamic QR code payment gateway.

## Frontend Consumer (out of scope)

The SPA frontend (ReactJS) runs on a separate domain and consumes the REST API.
The backend MUST support:

- **CORS** with `supports_credentials: true`.
- **Sanctum SPA cookie** authentication (stateful domains).

Do NOT generate or modify frontend code in this codebase.
